                    "type": "text",
                    "content": "Here's what I found for your Paris trip! \ud83c\uddeb\ud83c\uddf7\n\n## \ud83c\udf5c Restaurant Recommendation\n\nI checked all Chinese restaurants that are **open on Mondays** and **under 34\u20ac per person**:\n\n| Restaurant | Cuisine | Open Mondays? | Price/person | Rating |\n|-----------|---------|---------------|--------------|--------|\n| **New Asiaway** | Chinese | \u2705 Yes | 30\u20ac | \u2b50 **4.6** |\n| The yard | Chinese | \u2705 Yes | 30\u20ac | 4.3 |\n\n*(Note: Royal Panda and China Garden were excluded \u2014 Royal Panda is closed Mondays, and China Garden is 35\u20ac, over budget.)*\n\n**\ud83d\udc49 Recommended: New Asiaway**\n- Authentic Chinese cuisine with a modern twist, fresh ingredients, flavorful sauces, attentive staff, and a great ambiance. It also has an excellent selection of wines. At 30\u20ac/person with a 4.6 rating, it's the clear winner!\n\n## \ud83d\ude97 Car Rental Recommendation\n\n| Company | Price/day | Rating |\n|---------|-----------|--------|\n| **Paris Rent-a-Car** | 45\u20ac | \u2b50 **4.5** |\n| Eiffel Tower Car Rental | 60\u20ac | 5.0 |\n\nOnly **Paris Rent-a-Car** fits under your 50\u20ac budget (Eiffel Tower Car Rental is 60\u20ac/day, over budget).\n\n**\ud83d\udc49 Recommended: Paris Rent-a-Car**\n- Great service and well-maintained vehicles, a convenient location near the Louvre, helpful English-speaking staff, and easy pick-up/drop-off. At 45\u20ac/day with a 4.5 rating, it's the best option within your budget!\n\n**Summary:** Restaurant \u2192 **New Asiaway** | Car Rental \u2192 **Paris Rent-a-Car**\n\nWould you like me to make a reservation at New Asiaway for Monday, or book the car rental for you?"
